Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add OAuth sign-in for third-party connectors

Authorization code with PKCE, dynamic client registration, a consent page, and a page to revoke an app. Access and refresh tokens are opaque and stored as SHA-256 hashes. Generation, upload, library list, and job history accept an artcraft_oauth_at_ token when it has the scope that route needs. API keys stay unscoped. A present Authorization header does not fall through to the website cookie.
